Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:14:59.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:00.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是海！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:07.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:08.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:11.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:15.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:21.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:26.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦 亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:29.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:30.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:33.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:35.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:37.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:44.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:45.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:48.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:54.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:57.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊！是游泳圈變的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:15:59.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不會沉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:02.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才能在水面上行動自如
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:03.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:08.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,在海面上 亂暴獸都不需要出手和踩水！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:10.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.95,0:16:11.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:15.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:19.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要放掉空氣...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:22.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦 亂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你就浮不起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:26.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:31.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦... 亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:33.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:37.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦 啦 啦 啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:38.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦 亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.61,0:16:39.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:40.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:42.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:45.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:50.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,放掉空氣  一同砸進了海裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:54.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,“聰明反被聰明誤” 指的就是你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:56.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,太愚蠢了 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:09.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦 亂 亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:13.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:14.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:18.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:22.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦亂...暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:24.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:28.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:31.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:39.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,放鬆身體 輕柔地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:43.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就像漂浮在天空中一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:51.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這並不是必須要跨越的壁壘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:54.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就像... 漂浮在天空中一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:02.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大海... 玩得很開心吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:10.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的 你能游的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:19.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,浮起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:34.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈... 勝負已分 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:41.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就如同海藻碎屑般 葬身魚腹吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.53,0:18:43.18,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:48.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:49.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:52.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,正在游！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:54.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:02.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快放了大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:07.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:10.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:19.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:24.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:35.36,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,雙色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:36.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:36.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:39.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:39.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:45.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,活力 飛揚起來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:55.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:20:00.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...暴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:06.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,還挺能幹的啊 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:09.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因為大伙教會了我大海有多精彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:12.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這是與大伙結成的 團隊的圈的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:17.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有團隊圈 我就不再需要游泳圈了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:23.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是躺著的時候嗎！給我上 亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:25.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:36.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空藍！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:36.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:41.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,稜鏡白！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:41.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
