Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.30,0:21:16.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,修為不足啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:20.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,去找個地方 重煉吾的肌肉吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,彌諾彤彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:30.09,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,米麗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.26,0:21:31.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很美麗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:34.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,彷彿與天空連成了一體
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:42.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 媽媽 暑假就要結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:46.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今年夏天 快樂的事情太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:56.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,因為和大伙在一起 才度過了這最棒的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:22:01.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太棒了... 夏天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:09.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我  Cure Precious！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:09.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1090,975)}珍奇愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:12.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家來一起 美味微笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:12.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}{\fs50\pos(1090,975)}Delicious Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.49,0:23:50.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 小空 夢幻般的可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.61,0:23:53.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 說最喜歡我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:23:54.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:56.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才確實有人！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:00.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:00.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:03.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,新的威脅！救回小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:24.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:29.84,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:35.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:43.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:48.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:52.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:53.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:58.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:02.87,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:04.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:09.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:13.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:16.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:18.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:18.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:24.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
